deco-iot-vlan persistence source alpha

The authored persistence modules and UI extensions are experimental source code.
The vendor-patches files describe modifications to source shipped with TP-Link
Deco firmware. Eleven inputs use unified patches; the minified locale uses
compact byte edits containing only newly inserted text. Complete stock-derived
scripts/UI config files are not included.
