No TP-Link firmware image, compiled LuCI module, route-cache binary, private
profile, device credential, installation receipt, or diagnostic trace is included.
Stock-source hashes in the UI metadata describe required device-side files;
they are not embedded copies or proof that an arbitrary device matches.

The public UI uses generic node labels and a zero-valued historical migration
sentinel. Those release-specific changes are recorded in source-inventory.json.
The production guest hooks are included; temporary Keller diagnostic trace hooks
are excluded. This package makes no guest VLAN591 repair claim.
